# Post-battle briefing.
<machine_speech><gray>Battle log — outcome: <shining>{result}<\shining>. Duration {ticks} ticks. Own losses {lost}. Enemy destroyed {killed}. Fleet strength {ships}.<\gray>
?if result = victory
<gray>The wall stood and did not matter. The shipyard was the head.<\gray>
?else
<gray>The wall was grinding you down. The teleporter is the way around it.<\gray>
?end
?if notes ~ teleporter
<gray>[ Cross-reference: the operator's notes mention the teleporter. ]<\gray>
?end
